><span class=title> <img src="http://www.ezboard.com/images/posticons/pi_sunglasses.gif" align=absmiddle>  Token Iksar Warrior applying for guild status</span><hr size=1> Hello folks!  I would like to apply to Abyss.  I have been a member of Blood Inferno since the creation of this character as well as my level 50 druid Ryeza.  I am currently level 54 with full planar armour with no need for further weapons.  I am a master brewer, blacksmith and fletcher.  I have led many raids in all planes including Plane of Growth, and excluding Sky and Mischief.  <br>
<br>
So those are my stats currently.  My main reason for applying to Abyss is to carry on grouping with my friends who were recently in BI with me.  These friends include Sondor, Tharagor, Zourjn, Gherant... just to name a few.  I would also like to contribute my skills as " a full fledged meatshield!"  :)  I also understand that the Abyss is a very tight group and puts the interest of all it's members ahead of any single players needs.  This is exactly what I am looking for.  <br>
<br>
So I do hope to group with many members as frequently as possible.  Please send me a tell ingame if you ever require the services of a 54 Warrior named Gerr. <p><P><center><table border="5" bgcolor="#000000" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
